{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1dafed86-b1b9-40ab-929f-378a1744c60c",
    "name": "PaymentDemo",
    "description": "Endpoints for Payment.Api (PaymentsController) and PaymentProvider.Mock (ChargesController).\n\nDefault base URLs match the `http` launch profiles. Switch to the https profile values (https://localhost:7085 / https://localhost:7111) in the collection variables if needed.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "2260620",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/2260620-1dafed86-b1b9-40ab-929f-378a1744c60c?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Payment.Api - Payments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));\nconst body = pm.response.json();\nif (body && body.id) {\n    pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentId', body.id);\n}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{Idempotency-Key}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"amount\": 49.99,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}/api/payments",
              "host": [
                "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "payments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates a payment. Returns 201 with the PaymentRecord and saves its id to the `paymentId` collection variable."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Payment - Declined (amount > 10,000)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"amount\": 15000,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}/api/payments",
              "host": [
                "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "payments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The mock provider declines amounts over 10,000."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Payment - Invalid (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"\",\n  \"amount\": 0,\n  \"currency\": \"US\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}/api/payments",
              "host": [
                "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "payments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fails validation: empty orderId, zero amount, and a 2-letter currency."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payment By Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "payments",
                "{{paymentId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns 200 with the PaymentRecord, or 404 if not found. Run 'Create Payment' first to populate `paymentId`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payments By Order Id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}/api/payments/by-order/{{orderId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{paymentApiBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "payments",
                "by-order",
                "{{orderId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns all payments for the given order id (empty list if none)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "## Payment.Api — Payments\n\nThis folder contains the payment creation and retrieval endpoints for the **Payment API**. It covers the full range of scenarios for `POST /api/payments` and `GET /api/payments/...`, including the happy-path (successful creation and lookup), a **declined** payment (amounts over 10,000 rejected by the mock provider), and an **invalid** request that triggers a `400` validation error (empty `orderId`, zero amount, and a 2-letter currency code).\n\nRetrieval requests depend on the `{{paymentId}}` and `{{orderId}}` collection variables — run **Create Payment** first to populate `paymentId` before executing **Get Payment By Id**."
    },
